{'symbol': 'HSIC', 'date': '2023-02-03 11:18:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN DENTAL ASSOCIATION FOUNDATION KICKS OFF THE 21ST YEAR OF GIVE KIDS A SMILE® WITH EXCLUSIVE NATIONAL SPONSORS, HENRY SCHEIN AND COLGATE-PALMOLIVE', 'text': "CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE AMERICAN DENTAL ASSOCIATION FOUNDATION ANNOUNCES THE 21ST YEAR OF ITS GIVE KIDS A SMILE (GKAS) PROGRAM, WHICH OFFICIALLY LAUNCHES TODAY AT THIS YEAR'S NATIONAL KICK-OFF EVENT IN ST. LOUIS, MO WHERE THE PROGRAM FIRST BEGAN. SINCE ITS NATIONAL LAUNCH IN 2003, GKAS VOLUNTEERS HAVE PROVIDED FREE ORAL HEALTH EDUCATION AND SERVICES TO MORE THAN SEVEN MILLION UNDERSERVED CHILDREN IN THE U.S. TO LEARN MORE ABOUT THE PROGRAM'S IMPACT ON HELPING IMPROVE ORAL HEALTH AND TOTAL HEALTH OVER THE YEARS, CLICK HERE TO WATCH LAST YEAR'S 20TH ANNIVERSARY VIDEO."}